  "source_text": "poly = fill(1, 0)\npoly[0] = floor(5*abs(exp(6.283185307179586i*t1)+exp(6.283185307179586i*t2)))+1\npoly\npoly = scan(40, 0, 0, (k-tos[0]*floor(k/tos[0]))*exp(3.141592653589793i*(k+1)/(tos[0]+exp(6.283185307179586i*t1)+exp(6.283185307179586i*t2))))\ndrop\npoly = rev(poly)\nemit\n"
